      "writtenOn": "2014-10-27T21:49:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SINK_NOT_CHARGING is a port that is acting as a sink, but we are not charging from it (CHARGE_EN gpio is not set). This will happen when you plug in two chargers, one port will be SINK and the other SINK_NOT_CHARGING. That way the host can tell which side we are charging from.",
      "parentUuid": "15a5d282_e660a0ab",
      "revId": "365ef8c5da5bc0ee6a70bd9f40a3feb79d457316",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
